; CellAge curated rows — a COMMITTED SLICE of the real ETL output.
;
; build/ is gitignored, so the inference path (cellage_calibration.metta +
; ontology.cellage_selector) would otherwise be untestable on a fresh checkout.
; These blocks are copied VERBATIM from build/cellage_genes.metta, generated by
; cellage_etl.py from data/cellage/cellage3.tsv — not hand-written, not edited.
;
; The gene set is chosen to cover both effect directions, all four senescence
; types, both cell contexts, and several genes that CellAge and GenAge human
; share (TP53, SIRT1, AKT1, PARP1), so the intersection is exercisable too.
;
; It is a SAMPLE. 25 rows out of 927. Anything ranking or counting off it is
; ranking or counting a sample, and must say so.

